    <string name="reader_watch_desc">Reads only book titles, authors, progress, due dates and covers on the shelf and search screens, and the title and progress on the reading screen, of Kyobo Library, Kyobo eBook, Millie, Aladin, Bookers, Ridi, YES24 (Library, my YES, eBook) and Moon+ Reader to fill your reading list. Book text and other apps are not seen, and nothing leaves the device.</string>
    <string name="open_app_info">Open App info</string>
    <string name="restricted_hint">If Pebble Desk is greyed out in Accessibility (restricted setting), tap it once and close the notice first, then open App info › ⋮ at the top right › Allow restricted settings and turn it on again.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title">Getting started</string>
    <string name="onboarding_intro">Just open a book and your home fills itself. Turn on these two.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_on">On ✓</string>
    <string name="onboarding_start">Start  ›</string>
    <string name="onboarding_settings_hint">You can change these anytime in Settings › Reading</string>
    <string name="onboarding_books_desc">Open a book in an ebook app such as Kyobo Library or Millie and it appears at the top of your home.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_books_note">Only titles, authors, progress and covers on the shelf and reading screens are read; book text and other apps are never seen.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_time_desc">Records how long you read in ebook apps each day and shows it at the bottom of your home. Tap it for your reading log.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_time_note">With auto-add on, time is counted per book.</string>
